     PREDICTED branch total   nu_0 floor  canonical : slope +0.0867 dex/z, total +0.482 dex over z = 9 -> 14.5 (gain 1.1828 -> 1.1338)
     PREDICTED branch total   nu_0 floor  alt       : slope +0.0932 dex/z, total +0.521 dex over z = 9 -> 14.5 (gain 1.1936 -> 1.1441)
     PREDICTED branch baryon  nu_0 ceil   canonical : slope -0.0656 dex/z, total -0.531 dex over z = 9 -> 14.5 (gain 1.0215 -> 0.9496)
